      "answer": "C",
      "reason_rejected": "Left/right brain differences are a neurological hypothesis, not a sociobiological explanation for sex‑biased prevalence."
    },
    {
      "answer": "D",
      "reason_rejected": "Sociobiology does not assert that male brains are generally “better developed” than female brains; the claim is value‑laden and unsupported."
    }
